  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "We’re triggering earthquakes.",
      "start": 0.2,
      "end": 1.429
    },
    {
      "text": "And we know how.",
      "start": 1.629,
      "end": 2.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep beneath America’s oil fields,",
      "start": 2.74,
      "end": 4.804
    },
    {
      "text": "something unexpected is happening.",
      "start": 4.804,
      "end": 6.335
    },
    {
      "text": "Companies pump enormous amounts of",
      "start": 6.375,
      "end": 7.999
    },
    {
      "text": "wastewater underground.",
      "start": 7.999,
      "end": 9.13
    },
    {
      "text": "That fluid can increase pressure along",
      "start": 9.17,
      "end": 11.101
    },
    {
      "text": "faults already under stress.",
      "start": 11.101,
      "end": 12.508
    },
    {
      "text": "And sometimes, those faults slip.",
      "start": 12.658,
      "end": 14.515
    },
    {
      "text": "In twenty sixteen,",
      "start": 14.815,
      "end": 15.917
    },
    {
      "text": "a magnitude five point eight earthquake",
      "start": 15.917,
      "end": 17.855
    },
    {
      "text": "struck near Pawnee, Oklahoma.",
      "start": 17.855,
      "end": 19.328
    },
    {
      "text": "Researchers linked that sequence to",
      "start": 19.368,
      "end": 20.856
    },
    {
      "text": "wastewater injection.",
      "start": 20.856,
      "end": 21.81
    },
    {
      "text": "But here’s what most people get wrong.",
      "start": 22.11,
      "end": 23.551
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s not usually the drilling itself.",
      "start": 23.801,
      "end": 25.538
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s what happens deep",
      "start": 25.578,
      "end": 26.596
    },
    {
      "text": "underground afterward.",
      "start": 26.596,
      "end": 27.675
    },
    {
      "text": "And yes — humans really can",
      "start": 27.975,
      "end": 29.604
    },
    {
      "text": "trigger earthquakes.",
      "start": 29.604,
      "end": 30.525
    }
  ],
